{
  "id": "datetime-lens",
  "name": "时间与时区调试台",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "「为什么 02:30 的定时任务没触发」「这个时间戳是秒还是毫秒」的日期时间调试刚需。多格式解析为权威解读（ISO 8601/RFC 3339、Unix 秒/毫秒/微秒/纳秒按位数猜单位列歧义、RFC 2822、HTTP 日期、date-only），多时区投影标注偏移与 DST，墙钟消解对夏令时边界给确定性判定（时钟前拨不存在/回拨出现两次），日历口径 vs 精确口径双结果算术，全格式输出附 round-trip 自证；坑检测：date-only 按 UTC、无偏移按本地时区、两位年、闰秒、2038、ISO 周年错位、月末钳制 vs JS 回卷、JS Date.parse 差分实况。自研语法与 Intl/ICU 差分对拍守护，纯本地零外联零 kv，MCP 五工具（parse/convert/wall_resolve/arith/format）+ 面板。",
  "enabledByDefault": true,
  "contributes": {
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "datetime-lens.panel",
        "area": "activityBar",
        "panelType": "datetime-lens",
        "icon": "Clock",
        "labelKey": "plugins.datetime-lens",
        "labelDefault": "时间与时区调试台",
        "order": 95
      }
    ],
    "panel": {
      "entry": "./dist/panel.js",
      "supportsFullscreen": false
    },
    "mcpServers": [
      {
        "id": "datetime-lens",
        "transport": "stdio",
        "command": "node",
        "argsTemplate": ["{{pluginDir}}/mcp/server.js"]
      }
    ]
  },
  "permissions": {
    "aiToolAccess": true
  },
  "origin": {
    "repository": "https://github.com/misxzaiz/Polaris-plugin",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/misxzaiz/Polaris-plugin/tree/main/plugins/datetime-lens",
    "updateUrl": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/misxzaiz/Polaris-plugin@main/plugins/datetime-lens/update.json",
    "downloadUrl": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/misxzaiz/Polaris-plugin@main/plugins/datetime-lens/datetime-lens.zip"
  }
}
